// Reaction ward: D&D's "+5 AC until the start of your next turn" (also
// blocking Magic Missile outright, not modeled -- no per-spell-immunity
// primitive) becomes the same flat `ProtectingWard` damage reduction every
// AC-flavored ward in this file uses, strength set above blade_ward's
// (0.15) since this is a much stronger, single-hit-focused spike rather
// than a lingering light ward.
SelfBuff(
    buildup_duration: 0.2,
    cast_duration: 0.1,
    recover_duration: 0.25,
    buffs: [
        BuffDesc(kind: ProtectingWard, data: BuffData(strength: 0.35, duration: Some(6.0))),
    ],
    energy_cost: 15.0,
    meta: (school: Some(Abjuration), source: Some(Arcane)),
)
